Package: ReAnnotateR
Title: Re-annotate Genomic Intervals from BED Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Julia", "Gilley", email="julia.gilley@mail.utoronto.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to annotate genomic regions from BED files by linking intervals to genes, genomic features, and biological functions. Includes visualization and enrichment analysis.
